WEBVTT

00:00:18.401 --> 00:00:20.403
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.671
Lumos.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:41.686
[GROWLS]

00:00:42.948 --> 00:00:45.472
[PANTING]

00:00:45.515 --> 00:00:48.257
[♪♪♪]

00:00:48.301 --> 00:00:50.129
[SPLASHING]

00:00:54.394 --> 00:00:57.005
Lumos Maxima!

00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:08.321
DUMBLEDORE:
Harry.

00:01:08.364 --> 00:01:09.670
[SCREECHES]

00:01:11.629 --> 00:01:14.283
Sectumsempra!Harry.

00:01:14.327 --> 00:01:17.025
Stupefy!DUMBLEDORE: Harry.

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:34.652
[GROANING]

00:01:52.887 --> 00:01:54.672
[♪♪♪]

00:01:59.633 --> 00:02:02.549
[GASPING]

00:02:13.473 --> 00:02:15.823
[PANTING]

00:02:15.867 --> 00:02:18.260
Harry.

00:02:21.046 --> 00:02:23.831
Partis Temporus!

00:02:31.404 --> 00:02:33.449
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

00:02:45.592 --> 00:02:47.594
[BELL DINGS]

00:02:54.819 --> 00:02:57.735
[THUNDER CRASHING]

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.616
Go to your houses.
No dawdling.

00:03:09.659 --> 00:03:11.749
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.712
[ANIMAL SQUEAKING]

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.287
[TICKING]

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.509
[DOOR OPENING]

00:03:33.553 --> 00:03:36.034
[♪♪♪]

00:03:50.004 --> 00:03:52.702
We need to get you
to the hospital wing, sir,

00:03:52.746 --> 00:03:53.834
to Madam Pomfrey.

00:03:56.097 --> 00:03:58.534
No.

00:03:58.578 --> 00:04:01.363
Severus.
Severus is who I need.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:05.019
Wake him.
Tell him what happened.

00:04:05.063 --> 00:04:06.891
Speak to no one else.

00:04:06.934 --> 00:04:10.677
Severus, Harry.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.549
[DOOR OPENS AND CLOSES]

00:04:14.899 --> 00:04:17.640
Hide yourself below, Harry.

00:04:18.772 --> 00:04:20.426
Don't speak
or be seen by anybody

00:04:20.469 --> 00:04:21.906
without my permission.

00:04:21.949 --> 00:04:23.429
Whatever happens,

00:04:23.472 --> 00:04:25.910
it's imperative
you stay below.

00:04:25.953 --> 00:04:28.347
Harry, do as I say.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.392
[DOOR OPENS AND CLOSES]

00:04:31.567 --> 00:04:33.308
Trust me.

00:04:34.919 --> 00:04:36.964
Trust me.

00:04:56.897 --> 00:04:58.986
Good evening, Draco.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:03.295
What brings you here
on this fine spring evening?

00:05:03.338 --> 00:05:05.166
Who else is here?
I heard you talking.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.994
DUMBLEDORE:
I often talk aloud to myself.

00:05:07.038 --> 00:05:09.518
I find it extraordinarily
useful.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:14.697
Have you been whispering
to yourself, Draco?

00:05:16.743 --> 00:05:18.397
DUMBLEDORE:
Draco,

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.314
you are no assassin.How do you know what I am?

00:05:22.357 --> 00:05:24.272
I've done things
that would shock you.

00:05:24.316 --> 00:05:26.535
DUMBLEDORE:
Like cursing Katie Bell
and hoping that in return

00:05:26.579 --> 00:05:28.276
she'd bear a cursed necklace
to me?

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.062
Like replacing a bottle of mead
with one laced with poison?

00:05:31.105 --> 00:05:32.846
Forgive me, Draco.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.066
I cannot help feeling
these actions are so weak

00:05:35.109 --> 00:05:38.025
that your heart can't really
have been in them.

00:05:38.069 --> 00:05:41.420
He trusts me. I was chosen.

00:05:45.076 --> 00:05:47.034
Then I shall make it easy
for you.

00:05:47.078 --> 00:05:48.818
Expelliarmus!

00:05:52.083 --> 00:05:54.868
DUMBLEDORE:
Very good. Very good.

00:05:54.912 --> 00:05:56.130
[DOOR OPENS AND CLOSES]

00:05:56.174 --> 00:05:58.132
DUMBLEDORE:
You're not alone.

00:05:58.176 --> 00:05:59.873
There are others.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:04.356
How?

00:06:04.399 --> 00:06:07.750
The vanishing cabinet
in the Room of Requirement.

00:06:07.794 --> 00:06:10.405
I've been mending it.DUMBLEDORE: Let me guess.

00:06:10.449 --> 00:06:13.582
It has a sister. A twin.

00:06:13.626 --> 00:06:15.933
In Borgin and Burkes.
They form a passage.

00:06:15.976 --> 00:06:18.283
DUMBLEDORE:
Ingenious.

00:06:18.326 --> 00:06:19.806
Draco,

00:06:19.849 --> 00:06:22.417
years ago, I knew a boy

00:06:22.461 --> 00:06:26.726
who made all the wrong choices.

00:06:26.769 --> 00:06:30.425
Please let me help you.I don't want your help!

00:06:30.469 --> 00:06:34.125
Don't you understand?
I have to do this.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.084
I have to kill you.

00:06:37.128 --> 00:06:39.739
Or he's gonna kill me.

00:06:41.741 --> 00:06:43.308
[FOOTSTEPS]

00:06:46.311 --> 00:06:49.009
[♪♪♪]

00:06:49.053 --> 00:06:53.753
Well,
look what we have here.

00:06:53.796 --> 00:06:56.886
Well done, Draco.

00:07:00.499 --> 00:07:03.284
DUMBLEDORE:
Good evening, Bellatrix.

00:07:03.328 --> 00:07:05.460
I think introductions
are in order, don't you?

00:07:05.504 --> 00:07:07.158
Love to, Albus,

00:07:07.201 --> 00:07:11.249
but I'm afraid we're all
on a bit of a tight schedule.

00:07:11.292 --> 00:07:13.816
Do it.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:18.299
GREYBACK:
He doesn't have the stomach,
just like his father.

00:07:18.343 --> 00:07:20.258
Let me finish him in my own way.

00:07:20.301 --> 00:07:24.044
BELLATRIX:
No! The Dark Lord was clear,
the boy is to do it.

00:07:24.088 --> 00:07:26.220
This is your moment. Do it.

00:07:27.656 --> 00:07:29.876
Go on, Draco.

00:07:29.919 --> 00:07:32.400
Now!

00:07:32.444 --> 00:07:35.273
SNAPE:
No.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.416
DUMBLEDORE:
Severus.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.166
Please.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.950
Avada Kedavra.

00:08:03.866 --> 00:08:06.260
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

00:08:06.304 --> 00:08:08.219
[♪♪♪]

00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:18.925
[YELLS]

